-- Reuses the exact upsert semantics of public.import_reg_and_monthly() /
-- private.import_reg_and_monthly() (member upsert by member_no, one-time
-- registration + monthly fund subscriptions, transactions deduped on
-- (member_id, fund_id, for_month), full audit trail) but runs as a plain
-- migration instead of the RPC, since the RPC requires an authenticated
-- auth.uid() session that a migration run doesn't have. Attribution falls
-- back to the first super_admin/admin user found, or NULL if none exists.
--
-- Idempotent: re-running is safe. Existing transactions are only touched if
-- amount/date actually differ (and logged as an 'update'); everything else
-- is a no-op ('unchanged').

